      "problem": "$a+2b+2a-b=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we group the like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+2b+2a-b & = \\\\ {{a+2a}_{⏟}}_{a\\text{ terms}}+{{2b-b}_{⏟}}_{b\\text{ terms}} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we combine the like terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a+2a}_{⏟}+{2b-b}_{⏟} & = \\\\ (1+2)a+(2-1)b & = \\\\ 3a+b\\end{aligned}\n$$",
